  <text id="title" x="86" y="50" width="520" height="40" font="heading" size="30" color="ink" wrap="false">How the platform turns process into value</text>
  <text id="subtitle" x="86" y="108" width="1040" height="52" font="body" size="20" color="muted" line-height="1.35"><p>The platform combines land-linked intake, agency decision flow, field execution, and trusted records into outcomes that are economically visible.</p></text>

