  <shape id="benefit-card-1" type="rect" x="86" y="454" width="340" height="146" fill="mist" stroke="hairline" stroke-width="1"/>
  <icon id="benefit-1-icon" name="building-2" x="110" y="480" width="28" height="28" color="brand"/>
  <text id="benefit-1-title" x="150" y="476" width="220" height="24" font="strong" size="20" color="ink" wrap="false">Public coordination</text>
  <text id="benefit-1-body" x="110" y="520" width="276" height="56" font="body" size="17" color="muted" line-height="1.35"><p>Federal and state actors work from one case truth instead of fragmented files and untracked follow-up.</p></text>

  <shape id="benefit-card-2" type="rect" x="470" y="454" width="340" height="146" fill="mist" stroke="hairline" stroke-width="1"/>
  <icon id="benefit-2-icon" name="scan-search" x="494" y="480" width="28" height="28" color="chart-blue"/>
  <text id="benefit-2-title" x="534" y="476" width="220" height="24" font="strong" size="20" color="ink" wrap="false">Better decisions</text>
  <text id="benefit-2-body" x="494" y="520" width="276" height="56" font="body" size="17" color="muted" line-height="1.35"><p>Reviewers see parcel context, evidence, extracted data, and handoff history in one place before acting.</p></text>

  <shape id="benefit-card-3" type="rect" x="854" y="454" width="340" height="146" fill="mist" stroke="hairline" stroke-width="1"/>
  <icon id="benefit-3-icon" name="badge-dollar-sign" x="878" y="480" width="28" height="28" color="accent"/>
  <text id="benefit-3-title" x="918" y="476" width="220" height="24" font="strong" size="20" color="ink" wrap="false">Economic outcomes</text>
  <text id="benefit-3-body" x="878" y="520" width="276" height="56" font="body" size="17" color="muted" line-height="1.35"><p>That translates into quicker approvals, stronger state revenue, better trust, and safer private investment.</p></text>

